      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a draft for our museum's new policy on disputed artifacts (the stuff we got during colonial times). i need an introductory paragraph for the policy document that explains the context of why we are reviewing these items and what the overall goal of the new policy is. can you write something professional that sets the stage?",
