      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dear Museum Community,\n\nIn recognition of the profound complexities and sensitivity surrounding our artifact collections, acquired during the colonial era, we have embarked on a conscientious review of their provenance and histories. This initiative reflects our commitment to ethical stewardship of cultural heritage and acknowledges the need to reconcile with communities affected by colonial governance. The overarching aim of our new policy is to establish a transparent, fair, and respectful process for divesting, restituting, or commemorating disputed artifacts, thereby fostering meaningful dialogue and healing. Together, we will navigate this historical reckoning with integrity and hope for a shared, just future. Thank you for your understanding and collaboration.",
